(* A client of the compiler from Mid on, built from the layer alone
   (lib/compiler/mid.build), with no module of a front end
   (tests/runner/tools.sml, compiler/mid-client): a friend of the
   compiler's library, which may use the layer (docs/build.md, A library's
   header). *)
libraries unicode json end
../../build/config.sml
use ../../lib/compiler/mid.build
files ../../tests/compiler/mid-client.sml ../../tests/compiler/mid-client-main.sml end
